 "import": [
  "Import the GLB; each asset root is a Model of MeshParts <Asset>_<Role>. Re-centre with 'origin' (WorldPivot = CFrame.new(origin), then PivotTo); measure and undo the importer's 180-degree turn about Y as ItemAssets does.",
  "Give every part ONE SurfaceAppearance from its 'surfaceAppearance' block (ColorMap, NormalMap, RoughnessMap; MetalnessMap empty; AlphaMode Overlay); set its Color per 'tinting' at runtime.",
  "Every part: CanCollide/CanQuery/CanTouch false, CastShadow false (Config.Viewmodel.ArmShadows may turn it on), CollisionFidelity Box, Anchored, Material = robloxMaterial, Color = rgb (fallback).",
  "Attachments: create each one under the asset's first part with WorldCFrame = pivot * CFrame.lookAt(position, position + look, up) (art/README.md section 4).",
  "Hold items by aligning the item's Grip frame with R_/L_HandGrip.Grip (item:PivotTo(handGrip.WorldCFrame * itemGripLocal:Inverse())). Round food sits on Palm: centre = Palm + look * radius."
 ],
